# .claude

This folder is for Claude Code workspace customizations specific to this manuscript.

Things that may live here over time:

- `settings.local.json` — permissions, hooks, env vars for this manuscript only
- `agents/` — manuscript-specific subagents (e.g. a "voice-of-<narrator>" reviewer)
- `skills/` — skills unique to this manuscript

Shared skills (usable across all manuscripts) live in [`.claude/skills/` at the repo root](../../.claude/skills/).

The actual Claude guidance and context for this manuscript lives in the parent folder as [`CLAUDE.md`](../CLAUDE.md), not here.
